# GMS masters this at 10 and reduces 6*L% of the damage taken. Stretched to 20
# at half the step, landing on the same 60% -- which the Bandit's Shield
# Mastery also reaches, for half the points. It multiplies with the dodge
# Evasion Boost grants rather than summing with it.
#
# The barrier it really is, with a cap on what it can absorb, is not modelled:
# nothing here tracks damage dealt over a window.
name: "Aggressive Resistance"
skill_order: 6
description:
  "A barrier stands around you for good, reducing a share of the damage you "
  "take."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SNIPER
max_level: 20
base { damage_taken_pct: 0.03 }
per_level { damage_taken_pct: 0.03 }
